<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-15T17:53:41.069Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:53:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russia sent a major business delegation to Kabul for talks with the Taliban, while Pakistan security forces reported the death of a major among four troops and the killing of 24 terrorists in operations in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and Balochistan, according to ISPR. Police in Rajasthan arrested two suspects in a railway-track blast case and linked them to a Pakistani handler, and the Peshawar anti-terrorism court moved to declare Sohail Afridi a proclaimed offender in the Radio Pakistan attack. Pakistan and 16 other countries condemned an Israeli strike on a southern Gaza hospital, and Abdul Samad’s late strike sent Pakistan into the SAFF Championship final. The conflict accounted for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/russia-sends-major-business-delegation-to-kabul-for-business-talks-with-the-taliban&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5QZmxEODc2aHhyVmJ5WkdzWmkwangtQ3I2R2NZZG00VnktTE9JOUJXeVRndUlUTDBIYVBaZzNJcHY2RDNzbjFDaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5xV2hhaGdDdmdDUVFBWXdhQjhzNDJaOTBMaVU3ZUJVSTRNWG5FTGpKZ1NnQ1Y5UUZjY3p1TGVKaE5MakVZR255bg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9lQUV1RWlPTlFUR3l6QXFtb0dmMXp6UGNKcWFkVElKYm43bEhRa3JhUkQ3aXFieHFCWktaZXpjZkh0STBfSWpTYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5xUzR6MFprTWtFR0ZYaS1rM3FVZ2pOOW00cTZzVjh0b1NZUUxXTHdKTEx0bmdTaktpTUZSRzFuREtRc2xFcFVTZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
